import Wikipedia.HopfProblem.HolomorphicExponentialSheafLocalLogSection
import Wikipedia.HopfProblem.HolomorphicExponentialSheafLocalLogKernel

/-!
# Genuine local logarithms and the local kernel of the holomorphic exponential

Every actual holomorphic section has a holomorphic logarithm near each
nonzero value. Every actual holomorphic section with exponential one is
locally an integer multiple of `2πi`. Both conclusions use the original
complex charts on the original open subsets. No connectedness, separation,
countability, or assumed local logarithm is required.

This package supplies the analytic local statements only. It introduces no
unit sheaf, integer sheaf, or categorical exactness assertion.
-/
